# Always publish to the phone

XUANMO uses 日后 on iPhone via GitHub Pages: https://menxuanmo1-afk.github.io/rihou/

After you finish implementing or fixing something:
1. Commit the relevant files if there are uncommitted changes.
2. `git push` to `origin` (this repo’s `main`).
3. Tell them to wait about a minute, then refresh that URL (or reopen the home-screen icon).

Do not skip the push. This overrides the usual “don’t push unless asked.”
